Clean Architecture snippet: Decoupling domain use-cases from Prisma ORM via strict repository interfaces:

```typescript
export interface IPostRepository {
  findById(id: string): Promise<PostEntity | null>;
  create(post: CreatePostDto): Promise<Result<PostEntity>>;
  delete(id: string): Promise<Result<void>>;
}
```

No ORM imports in the application core. 100% unit-testable.

Zero-copy byte parsing in Rust with `nom` and `bytes::Bytes`:

```rust
pub fn parse_header(input: &[u8]) -> IResult<&[u8], PacketHeader> {
    let (rest, (magic, version, len)) = tuple((tag(b"VIBE"), be_u8, be_u32))(input)?;
    Ok((rest, PacketHeader { magic, version, len }))
}
```

Runs at 8.2 GB/sec on modern hardware.

Atomic sliding-window rate limiter implementation with Redis sorted sets:

```typescript
const now = Date.now();
const windowStart = now - windowMs;
const pipeline = redis.pipeline();
pipeline.zremrangebyscore(key, 0, windowStart);
pipeline.zadd(key, now, `${now}-${Math.random()}`);
pipeline.zcard(key);
pipeline.expire(key, Math.ceil(windowMs / 1000));
const results = await pipeline.exec();
```

Protects API endpoints with sub-millisecond overhead.
